# One line ending everywhere. Text is stored and checked out as LF on every
# platform, so a Windows clone does not have to set core.autocrlf: these
# attributes override it. A CRLF checkout makes `oxfmt --check` fail and turns
# every diff into a whole-file rewrite.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary: never normalised, never diffed as text.
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.png binary
*.webp binary
*.avif binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff2 binary
*.mp4 binary

